// Tier W1: an untyped integer literal coerces into a fixed-width annotation only when it fits the
// width's range. `300` does not fit `u8` (0..=255), so the coercion at the annotation is E0044: the
// same range rule as a suffixed literal, applied where the untyped literal meets the context.
// expect: error E0044 at 6:9
// expect: exit 1
x: u8 = 300
echo x
